n Street and describes its lion heads, Ionic columns, and Beaux Arts building.","source_url":"https://oneontahistory.org/events-programs/walking-tours/main-street-walking-tour/","source_title":"Main Street Walking Tour","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"View the exterior from the Main Street public corridor.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"historic-fw-woolworth-jj-newberry","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Historic F. W. Woolworth and J. J. Newberry buildings","title":"Trace Main Street’s chain-store past","subtitle":"Main Street corridor — 203–205 and 221–223 Main Street","notes":"Use the tour’s paired stops to compare these storefront blocks and learn how national chains once occupied Main Street.","short_summary":"Two Main Street addresses documented as former Woolworth’s and Newberry’s locations.","evidence_claim":"The walking tour identifies the historic F. W. Woolworth and J. J. Newberry buildings at 203–205 and 221–223 Main Street.","source_url":"https://oneontahistory.org/events-programs/walking-tours/main-street-walking-tour/","source_title":"Main Street Walking Tour","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"View the addressed building exteriors along Main Street.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"historic-wilber-national-bank","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Historic Wilber National Bank","title":"Find the bank’s phased facade","subtitle":"Main Street corridor — 233–241 Main Street","notes":"Walk past this block and look for the building’s different construction phases, beginning with its west wing in 1907.","short_summary":"A former bank building whose construction began with a west wing in 1907.","evidenc